      "message": "This is a 10-patch chain. The goal is to add some unit tests for our seapp_context parsing and lookup. There is one test right now, but I\u0027ll add more later. The main issue with bringing these tests up is that most of android_platform.c expects to run on the device (and not on the host). 6 of the changes are to split android_platform.c into android_seapp.c (now buildable on host) and android_device.c. Because Git does not handle this kind of separation well, I had to create an explicit merge commit so that the history would be conserved (git blame on android_seapp.c and android_device.c would work as expected). So that\u0027s many changes but each should be trivial to review. \n\nI haven\u0027t added you explicitly to each change, but please review the whole chain. Thanks.",
